# .gitleaksignore — per-finding fingerprints to suppress historical
# matches that have been audited and confirmed NOT to be live secrets.
#
# Phase 260516-kya / Plan 01.
#
# History clean as of 2026-05-16 (verified via `git log -S` on .env
# contents). Add fingerprints here ONLY if a future audit surfaces a
# legitimate historical match that is NOT a live secret. For
# false-positive shapes you want to allow going forward, extend
# `.gitleaks.toml [allowlist]` instead (so the suppression is
# regression-tested by tools/lint-gitleaks-config.test.ts).
